🔒 Important Security Notes
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

⚠️  Do not share your merchant API key (x-merchant-key) with anyone.
⚠️  Do not store keys in the source code.
⚠️  Use Environment Variables to store keys.
⚠️  Make all API requests from the Server-Side, not from the Browser.
⚠️  Tokens are valid for 5 minutes only.
⚠️  Ensure HTTPS is used in all requests.


🔄 Correct Workflow
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. User enters card info (Card Number + CVV)
   ↓
2. Create temporary payment token using `create-payment-token`
   ↓
3. Initiate payment using `merchant-payment-initiate` with the token
   ↓
4. User enters PIN
   ↓
5. Complete payment using `merchant-payment-complete`
   ↓
6. Confirm transaction success


